; ==============================================================================
; DHAR IR - Stage 1 module (verbose bootstrap subset only)
; Status: STUB (Beta §3 backlog). Linear op list between AST and codegen
; (Spec0 §4: nothing above the IR knows hardware). Ops: const, mov, add,
; sub, mul, div, jump, branch, call, ret, load/store byte, syscall.
